# Design docs

## Locations

- Canonical design: `docs/design.md`
- Canonical roadmap: `docs/roadmap.md` (phases are provisional)
- Conventions: `docs/conventions.md`
- `.dev/` is temporary (reviews, scratch). Do not leave permanent decisions only there

## Changing the design

- **Contract / public API / semantics / phase boundaries / exception policy:** open a Design Issue and a design-only PR updating `docs/design.md` first; merge before implementation issues
- **Docs-only clarifications** (typos, wording, examples): may ship in the same PR as code
- Do not implement first and "update the design later"

When implementing, follow `docs/design.md`. If code and design conflict, stop and fix the design via the process above.
